From 2eadfb156fbe120e8f499f8d2a991996ce74bb4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 00:43:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 17/32] TM Case: label TMs as TMs again (identify HMs by item
 ID)

TMs are marked important so they can't be sold or tossed, which made the
TM Case draw them as HMs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
---
 src/tm_case.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/tm_case.c b/src/tm_case.c
index 8975761..bfca5f7 100644
--- a/src/tm_case.c
+++ b/src/tm_case.c
@@ -26,7 +26,8 @@
 #include "constants/quest_log.h"
 
 // Any item in the TM Case with nonzero importance is considered an HM
-#define IS_HM(itemId) (ItemId_GetImportance(itemId) != 0)
+// FireRed QoL+Hard: TMs are also "important" (reusable, unsellable), so check the ID
+#define IS_HM(itemId) ((itemId) >= ITEM_HM01)
 
 #define TAG_SCROLL_ARROW 110
 
